WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.190
It's a freezing morning.

2
00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:06.070
Snow covers the playground, and
the puddles have turned to ice.

3
00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:09.750
Does one day this cold mean the
planet can't be getting warmer?

4
00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:11.190
How could you tell?

5
00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:14.010
In this mission, you'll see
how the plates under your feet

6
00:00:14.060 --> 00:00:16.560
move, and what happens
where they meet.

7
00:00:16.610 --> 00:00:18.350
You'll meet the three rock groups,

8
00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:21.030
and see how weathering
breaks rock down.

9
00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:23.010
You'll compare weather and climate,

10
00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:26.650
and see how the Earth's climate
has changed since the last Ice

11
00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:26.990
Age.

12
00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:31.830
Your mission: decide what one
freezing day can tell you about

13
00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:33.060
the planet.
